{{- $c := .Local -}}
Operations that accept file uploads take the path to a local file in a file flag{{if $c.UploadCommand}} (`--{{$c.UploadFlag}}` on `{{$c.UploadCommand}}`):{{else}}.{{end}}
{{- if $c.UploadCommand}}

<!-- readme-examples: skip (needs a local file) -->
```bash
{{$c.UploadCommand}} --{{$c.UploadFlag}} ./photo.jpg
```
{{- end}}

The file is uploaded as a multipart form request. The CLI automatically detects the content type from the file extension.
